# TASK-260715-lovbdz rework 02 results\n\n## Implementation\n\n- Replaced the encoded-oversize false-positive fixture with thousands of unique valid metric names.\n- Independently encodes the same diagnostics models with deterministic sorted-key JSON to establish the actual byte counts.\n- Proves an otherwise-valid fitting payload succeeds through RuntimeMessageCodec.\n- Proves an otherwise-valid oversize payload throws the exact payloadTooLarge error with the diagnostics maximum and measured actual byte count.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Focused runtime codec suites: 15 tests in 2 suites passed.\n- make validate-core: boundary checks and native packaging verification passed; 183 tests in 21 suites passed; post-test swift build passed.\n- Repository swift-format strict lint passed.\n- git diff --check passed.\n- task-board validate passed.\n\nEvidence logs: TASK-260715-lovbdz_runtime-codecs-rework-02.log and TASK-260715-lovbdz_validate-core-rework-02.log.[0/1] Planning build
